Upstream:  @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent 0.84.4
Project:   https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Licence:   MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner

Redistributed verbatim from packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/,
byte-identical apart from the provenance header each file carries:

  agent/extensions/preset.ts
  agent/extensions/questionnaire.ts
  agent/extensions/todo.ts
  agent/extensions/tools.ts

None of the four is modified, and none has a dependency of its own.

This repository previously also redistributed the sandbox and plan-mode
examples. Both are now installed as maintained packages instead -- pi-sandbox
and @narumitw/pi-plan-mode -- because a vendored copy is a snapshot that stops
receiving fixes while still looking current.

